    "Weekdot imports the feed directly into its own Apple Calendar calendar. It checks for updates when the app is active. If a provider only offers a downloaded .ics file, a live URL is needed for automatic updates.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weekdot importeert de agenda rechtstreeks naar een aparte Apple-agenda en controleert updates terwijl de app actief is. Voor automatische updates is een live abonnementslink nodig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekdot shows every calendar from the Calendar app. Changes are saved in your accounts and synced with iCloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يعرض Weekdot كل التقويمات من تطبيق التقويم. تُحفظ التغييرات في حساباتك وتتم مزامنتها مع iCloud."
